<title>USA: INDIANA/OHIO DIRECT HOGS $0.50 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>INDIANA/OHIO DIRECT HOGS $0.50 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Demand was light to moderate on a moderate movement. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country				  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS. 54.50-55.50 Some 54.00 &amp; 56.00  55.00-56.50 US 2-3  230-260 LBS. 49.50-53.50</p>
